on-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fs-sm shadow-none rounded-brand-sm py-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-1" style="height:auto">2) How do I book “sofa cleaning near me” with Supersavvy?</button></h2><div id="flush-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample"><div class="accordion-body fs-sm">Call or message 7098110110 with your area, sofa type, and preferred time slot.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item border-bottom"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fs-sm shadow-none rounded-brand-sm py-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-2" style="height:auto">3) Do you offer same-day sofa cleaning?</button></h2><div id="flush-2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample"><div class="accordion-body fs-sm">Same-day service is available in many Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India locations (subject to slot availability). Contact early for the best chance.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item border-bottom"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fs-sm shadow-none rounded-brand-sm py-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#flush-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-3" style="height:auto">4) Which is better—sofa shampooing or sofa steam cleaning?</button></h2><div id="flush-3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFlushExample"><div class="accordion-body fs-sm">It depends on the fabric and sofa condition. Sofa shampooing service works well for routine deep refresh, while sofa steam cleaning is often preferred when hygiene and deeper cleansing are the goal. Supersavvy recommends after inspection.</div></div></div><div class="accordion-item border-bottom"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collaps