      </style></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"prodata":[{"_id":"693fed70c0a053ae9022f9e5","name":"Fabric Sofa Cleaning Services","category":"Home cleaning","subcategory":"sofa cleaning","__v":0},{"_id":"693fed77c0a053ae9022fa78","name":"Leather Sofa Cleaning Services","category":"Home cleaning","subcategory":"sofa cleaning","__v":0}],"subcat":"sofa-cleaning-in-rohini-sector-6-delhi-india","pagedetails":{"_id":"693fed25c0a053ae9022f6a0","name":"sofa cleaning","pricetable":[{"name":"","price":0}],"localities":[],"keywords":[""],"title":"Sofa Cleaning Service in Delhi | Deep Cleaning – SuperSavvy","description":"Need sofa cleaning in Delhi? SuperSavvy provides professional sofa deep cleaning to remove dust, stains \u0026 odors using safe cleaning methods.","faqs":[{"question":"1) Do you provide sofa cleaning at home in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India?","answer":"Yes. Supersavvy offers home sofa cleaning, doorstep sofa cleaning, and onsite sofa cleaning across Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India."},{"question":"2) How do I book “sofa cleaning near me” with Supersavvy?","answer":"Call or message 7098110110 with your area, sofa type, and preferred time slot."},{"question":"3) Do you offer same-day sofa cleaning?","answer":"Same-day service is available in many Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India locations (subject to slot availability). Contact early for the best chance."},{"question":"4) Which is better—sofa shampooing or sofa steam cleaning?","answer":"It depends on the fabric and sofa condition. Sofa shampooing service works well for routine deep refresh, while sofa steam cleaning is often preferred when hygiene and deeper cleansing are the goal. Supersavvy recommends after inspection."},{"question":"5) Do you do sofa dry cleaning?","answer":"Yes. Supersavvy provides sofa dry cleaning (low moisture) for delicate fabrics or faster drying requirements."},{"question":"6) Can you remove ink, coffee, food, and oil stains?","answer":"We offer sofa stain removal for common stains including ink, coffee/tea, food, and oil marks. Results vary based on stain age and fabric type, but we aim for the best improvement."},{"question":"7) Do you offer urine stain removal and odor control?","answer":"Yes. Supersavvy provides urine stain removal and odor neutralization support—very useful for pet homes."},{"question":"8) Can you remove pet hair from sofas?","answer":"Yes. Our process includes deep vacuuming and pet hair removal from fabric and crevices."},{"question":"9) Is the cleaning safe for kids and pets?","answer":"Yes. We use eco-friendly cleaning solutions and fabric-safe methods suitable for everyday households."},{"question":"10) Do you clean leather sofas?","answer":"Yes. Supersavvy provides leather sofa cleaning using gentle cleaning techniques and conditioning steps appropriate for leather surfaces."},{"question":"11) How long does sofa cleaning take?","answer":"Most standard sofa sets take around 60–120 minutes, depending on size and condition."},{"question":"12) How long does it take for the sofa to dry?","answer":"Drying time depends on the method, fabric, and ventilation. Low moisture methods usually dry faster. We share drying guidance after service."},{"question":"13) Do you clean office sofas and chairs?","answer":"Yes. Supersavvy cleans office sofas, reception seating, visitor chairs, and other upholstery."}],"carotext":"","extracontent":"\u003ch1\u003eSofa Cleaning Service in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupersavvy’s Same-Day Doorstep Sofa Shampooing, Deep Cleaning, Stain Removal \u0026amp; Sanitization\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour sofa is where life happens—family movie nights, guests, quick naps, kids playing, and sometimes even pets claiming their “spot.” Over time, that daily use leaves behind more than just visible dirt. Sofas can trap \u003cstrong\u003edust, allergens, sweat, food crumbs, pet hair, and odor\u003c/strong\u003e deep inside the upholstery—especially in a city like \u003cstrong\u003eRohini Sector 6 Delhi India\u003c/strong\u003e, where dust and pollution can settle quickly on fabric surfaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you’re searching for \u003cstrong\u003e“sofa cleaning near me”\u003c/strong\u003e in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India, \u003cstrong\u003eSupersavvy sofa cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e brings professional \u003cstrong\u003ehome sofa cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e right to your doorstep. We use fabric-safe methods like \u003cstrong\u003esofa shampooing service\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa deep cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa steam cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003esofa dry cleaning (low moisture)\u003c/strong\u003e to restore freshness, improve hygiene, and revive the look of your sofa—without you having to move furniture or deal with messy DIY cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYour Sofa Needs Deep Cleaning, Not Just Surface Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eRegular vacuuming and wiping help, but they often can’t solve:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eDeep dirt trapped inside cushions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSofa stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e for tea/coffee, oil, food, ink\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUrine stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e and pet-related odors\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDust mite removal\u003c/strong\u003e and allergen buildup\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMusty smell after damp weather or closed rooms\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSticky areas on armrests/headrests from daily use\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupersavvy’s \u003cstrong\u003ecouch cleaning service\u003c/strong\u003e is designed for \u003cstrong\u003edeep upholstery cleaning and extraction cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, so your sofa is not only cleaner on the outside—but cleaner where it matters: inside the fabric and foam layers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Supersavvy for Sofa Cleaning in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen it comes to upholstery, the right method, right tools, and right technician make all the difference. Supersavvy focuses on \u003cstrong\u003eresults + safety + convenience\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get with Supersavvy\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSame-day service (subject to availability):\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for urgent cleaning before guests, festivals, or rentals.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoorstep sofa cleaning:\u003c/strong\u003e 100% \u003cstrong\u003eonsite sofa cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e—no pickup, no shifting, no waiting.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrained cleaners:\u003c/strong\u003e Experienced \u003cstrong\u003eprofessional sofa cleaning technicians\u003c/strong\u003e who handle different materials safely.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEco-friendly shampooing:\u003c/strong\u003e Family-friendly solutions that are suitable for homes with kids and pets.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeep cleaning + quick-dry approach:\u003c/strong\u003e Controlled moisture with strong extraction so the sofa doesn’t stay wet for long.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStain + odor expertise:\u003c/strong\u003e Dedicated treatment for common stains and \u003cstrong\u003esofa odor removal\u003c/strong\u003e that targets the cause, not just the smell.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHygiene-first cleaning:\u003c/strong\u003e Add \u003cstrong\u003esofa sanitization\u003c/strong\u003e and anti-bacterial treatment when you want extra protection.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTransparent service experience:\u003c/strong\u003e Clear steps, realistic expectations, and after-care guidance.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eService guarantee mindset:\u003c/strong\u003e We aim for customer satisfaction with quality finishing and clean results you can feel.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOur Sofa Cleaning Services in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupersavvy provides a complete range of professional upholstery solutions. We recommend the best option after inspecting your sofa’s fabric and condition.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1) Sofa Shampooing / Foam Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003esofa shampooing service\u003c/strong\u003e uses upholstery shampoo/foam to break down dirt and body oils stuck in the fabric. It’s great for routine deep refresh and visible dullness.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2) Sofa Deep Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSofa deep cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e is our most recommended option for family homes. It includes vacuuming, spot treatment, shampoo/steam based on fabric, and extraction cleaning to remove dirt from deep inside.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3) Sofa Steam Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSofa steam cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e is chosen when you want stronger hygiene support. It helps loosen grime and supports \u003cstrong\u003esofa sanitization\u003c/strong\u003e, especially useful after long gaps between cleanings.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4) Sofa Dry Cleaning (Low Moisture)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed quicker drying or have sensitive upholstery? \u003cstrong\u003eSofa dry cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e uses controlled moisture methods to clean effectively without soaking the sofa—ideal for many delicate fabrics.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5) Sofa Stain Removal (Ink / Food / Oil / Coffee)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe perform stain-specific treatment for common problems like:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eInk/pen marks\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTea/coffee stains\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFood stains (sauces, snacks, curry spills)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOil/grease stains\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDirt and sweat patches (armrests/headrests)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003esofa stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e approach focuses on improving the stain without damaging the fabric.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e6) Sofa Odor Removal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003esofa odor removal\u003c/strong\u003e targets:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePet smell\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDamp/musty smell\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFood smell\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSmoke smell\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e We focus on neutralizing the odor source so the freshness lasts longer.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e7) Sofa Sanitization \u0026amp; Anti-Bacterial Treatment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdd \u003cstrong\u003esofa sanitization\u003c/strong\u003e when hygiene is your priority. This is popular for homes with kids, pet homes, and households that want a cleaner indoor environment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e8) Dust Mite Removal \u0026amp; Allergen Reduction\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThrough deep vacuuming and extraction, we support \u003cstrong\u003edust mite removal\u003c/strong\u003e and allergen cleanup—helpful for people with allergies and dust sensitivity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e9) Pet Hair Removal + Urine Stain Removal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor pet-friendly homes, we offer:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePet hair removal\u003c/strong\u003e from fabric and crevices\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUrine stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e + odor neutralization (especially for repeated accidents)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSofa Types We Clean\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupersavvy handles many sofa styles and upholstery types across Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSofa materials\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFabric sofa cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e (cotton blends, polyester, linen, mixed upholstery)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLeather sofa cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e (gentle method + conditioning approach)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSuede-like and delicate fabrics (cleaning method chosen after inspection)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSofa styles \u0026amp; seating\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e2-seater / 3-seater / 5-seater / 7-seater sets\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eL-shape / sectional sofas\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRecliners\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLoveseats\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSofa-cum-bed\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOttomans / pouffes\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLoose cushions and padded seating\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUpholstery add-ons\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can also add:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eChair upholstery cleaning (dining chairs / office chairs)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCarpet cleaning\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMattress cleaning\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCurtain cleaning\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHome cleaning services (deep cleaning packages)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow Supersavvy Sofa Cleaning Works: Step-by-Step\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe follow a structured process so results are consistent, safe, and visible.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 1: Inspection \u0026amp; Fabric Assessment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe check:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eFabric/leather type and sensitivity\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStain locations + severity\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHigh-use zones (armrests, headrests, seat edges)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAny delicate areas (loose stitching, worn patches)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 2: Deep Vacuuming\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe remove dust, crumbs, and debris—especially from corners, seams, and gaps where dirt hides.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 3: Stain \u0026amp; Spot Treatment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe apply targeted pre-treatment for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eInk, tea/coffee, food spills\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eOil marks\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePet accidents (\u003cstrong\u003eurine stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 4: Shampoo / Steam / Low-Moisture Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBased on the sofa type, we perform:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esofa shampooing service\u003c/strong\u003e, or\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esofa steam cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, or\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esofa dry cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e (low moisture)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 5: Extraction Cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe use extraction cleaning techniques to pull out loosened dirt and residues from deeper layers—this is where the “real” deep cleaning happens.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 6: Deodorizing + Sanitization\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf selected, we apply:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eodor neutralization for \u003cstrong\u003esofa odor removal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003esanitization layer for \u003cstrong\u003esofa sanitization\u003c/strong\u003e and better hygiene\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStep 7: Drying Guidance + Final Quality Check\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe guide you on:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eventilation tips\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eairflow/fan suggestions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ewhen to start using the sofa again\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e Then we do a final check for uniform cleaning and visible improvement.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBenefits You Get With Supersavvy Sofa Cleaning\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional \u003cstrong\u003esofa cleaning service\u003c/strong\u003e isn’t just about looks—it upgrades comfort and hygiene too.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat customers typically notice after cleaning\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCleaner feel:\u003c/strong\u003e less sticky, less dull fabric\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBetter appearance:\u003c/strong\u003e brighter upholstery and improved color tone\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReduced stains:\u003c/strong\u003e stain marks become lighter or disappear\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFresher smell:\u003c/strong\u003e reduced pet/food/damp odors\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAllergy support:\u003c/strong\u003e reduced dust and allergens trapped inside cushions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLonger sofa life:\u003c/strong\u003e regular deep cleaning helps reduce fabric wear from embedded dirt\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003ePricing Information for Sofa Cleaning in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupersavvy follows a transparent approach. Final cost is typically based on the sofa type and cleaning complexity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCommon pricing formats\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePer seat\u003c/strong\u003e (common for sofas and recliners)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePer set\u003c/strong\u003e (for standard sofa combinations)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial-based\u003c/strong\u003e (fabric vs leather vs delicate upholstery)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCondition-based\u003c/strong\u003e (light cleaning vs heavy stains + odor treatment)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBook Supersavvy Sofa Cleaning in Rohini Sector 6 Delhi India Today\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf your sofa looks dull, smells off, or has stains that won’t go away, it’s time for professional cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eSofa cleaning service\u003c/strong\u003e at your doorstep\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e ✅ \u003cstrong\u003eSofa deep cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa shampooing service\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa steam cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa dry cleaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e ✅ \u003cstrong\u003eSofa stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003esofa odor removal\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003edust mite removal\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003epet hair removal\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eurine stain removal\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e ✅ Trained technicians + quick-dry approach + hygiene-focused cleaning\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e📞 \u003cstrong\u003eCall or message Supersavvy now: 709811011